ote><p><b>target</b></p><p><b>type</b>: Task</p><p><b>params</b>: focus={ref}</p><blockquote><p><b>link</b></p><p><b>path</b>: Task.owner</p><p><b>min</b>: 1</p><p><b>max</b>: 1</p><p><b>description</b>: Get the PractitionerRole of the caregiver owner of the task</p><blockquote><p><b>target</b></p><p><b>type</b>: PractitionerRole</p><blockquote><p><b>link</b></p><p><b>path</b>: PractitionerRole.practitioner</p><p><b>min</b>: 1</p><p><b>max</b>: 1</p><p><b>description</b>: Get the Practitioner of the caregiver owner of the task</p><h3>Targets</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Practitioner</td></tr></table></blockquote></blockquote></blockquote></blockquote></blockquote></div>"
